    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.cursorword\n\n### Question\n\ncan it highlight matching words across all visible buffers rather than only the current buffer?\r\nI usually open two vertical buffers.",
