            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am afraid the answer is \"No\". Mostly because it will require more complexity from highlighting logic and because I occasionally find it useful to have word highlighting in a split window be \"frozen\" (i.e. not update as cursor moves in current window) for easier reference.",
